硬件测试工程师、功能测试工程师
Position Description:
1. Singal Integrety Test on High/Low-Speed data signals using Oscilloscope, Networking Analyzer, BERT
2. Strictly execute validation test according to the test procedure;
3. Do version control and record results in each version;
4. Submit and follow defects, write validation report at end of each project;
5. Ability to work independently and in a team environment to meet defined and assigned objectives based on established timelines and project scope.

Job Qualifications:
1. Good in English reading and writing; CET-4
2. Major in Electrical Engineering and basic computer skills;
3. Familar about data interfaces including USB/PCIE/SATA/TBT,etc.
4. Clear description of technical topics;
5. Having sense of responsibility and team work;
6. Able to work under schedule and good at time management.
